  //                          tick (docs/modules/smart-student-import.md §9).
  //                          The platform operator can still switch it off
  //                          per school.
  smartImportEnabled           Boolean         @default(true) @map("smart_import_enabled")
  //   smartImportConsent*    Smart Student Import beta (2026-10-24): who at
  //                          the school accepted, before its first scan, that
  //                          register photos are sent to the AI reading
  //                          service and then discarded. Null: not yet; the
  //                          scan refuses until it is given.
  smartImportConsentAt         DateTime?       @map("smart_import_consent_at")
  smartImportConsentBy         String?         @map("smart_import_consent_by")
  //   onboardingCallPrompt*  The "book a setup call" page shown once after
  //                          the setup wizard (2026-10-26,
  //                          docs/modules/onboarding-call.md). ClosedAt is
  //                          stamped when the owner books or skips, and the
  //                          page never shows again; BookedAt only when they
  //                          book, so the platform admin knows which schools
  //                          hold bookings without reading every school's.
  onboardingCallPromptClosedAt DateTime?       @map("onboarding_call_prompt_closed_at")
  onboardingCallBookedAt       DateTime?       @map("onboarding_call_booked_at")
  // Getting started (2026-10-30, docs/modules/activation.md): the owner pressed
  // "Stop these emails" in a setup reminder.
  setupEmailsStoppedAt         DateTime?       @map("setup_emails_stopped_at")
  //   assignmentFeedbackAiEnabled  Phase 9 / CP4b. The school's own opt-in to
  //                          AI drafts of marking feedback. OFF by default,
  //                          set by owner/admin; aiEnabled must be on too, and
  //                          a teacher still has to press the button.
  assignmentFeedbackAiEnabled  Boolean         @default(false) @map("assignment_feedback_ai_enabled")
  //   plan / studentCapOverride   the school's plan and, for a deal, its own
  //                          student cap (2026-10-11, docs/modules/plans.md).
  //                          Set by the platform operator only. Null override
